{"seq":8,"slug":"comprehensive-deepening-reform","title":"全面深化改革","stage":"DONE","category":"xi-jinping-thought","categoryLabel":"习近平思想","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/comprehensive-deepening-reform","rating":{"composite":3.7,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.67,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/03_xi-jinping-thought/08_comprehensive-deepening-reform","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"全面深化改革-简介\">全面深化改革 简介</h1><p>全面深化改革是新时代推进国家治理体系和治理能力现代化的总抓手。本知识库聚焦&quot;如何改&quot;这一核心问题：从十八届三中全会确立的改革蓝图与方法论出发，深入国企、财税、司法三大重点领域的攻坚实践，最终落到制度优势、现实挑战与未来方向的成效评估。它回答的是改革的<strong>顶层设计逻辑与实施机制</strong>，而非某一具体政策的得失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>习近平思想集群下多个 hub 在主题上相邻，本 hub 与它们的边界如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>hub</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全面深化改革（本 hub）</td>\n<td>改革的总体设计、方法论、重点领域攻坚与成效评估</td>\n<td>改革的&quot;操作系统&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../new-development-philosophy/\">新发展理念</a></td>\n<td>创新协调绿色开放共享的发展指导思想</td>\n<td>提供改革的发展目标与价值导向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../rule-of-law/\">全面依法治国</a></td>\n<td>法治体系、司法体制、监察体制的法理与制度</td>\n<td>司法改革的法治深度延伸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../party-self-revolution/\">党的自我革命</a></td>\n<td>全面从严治党、反腐、巡视</td>\n<td>改革的政治保障与落实主体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../governance-of-china/\">治国理政</a></td>\n<td>习近平治国理政思想的文本与命题</td>\n<td>改革思想的原典来源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>简言之：发展理念定方向、依法治国保规范、自我革命提供保障，而本 hub 讲的是把这些统筹起来&quot;怎么改、改什么、改得如何&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>决策与实施者（党政干部）</strong>：先读第一章<a href=\"reform-blueprint/top-level-design\">顶层设计</a>与<a href=\"reform-blueprint/reform-methodology\">改革方法论</a>掌握推进机制，再据本职领域选读第二章对应专题，最后看第三章<a href=\"assessment/reform-challenges\">改革挑战</a>对照落实难点。</li>\n<li><strong>研究者与师生</strong>：按&quot;蓝图→重点领域→评估&quot;顺序通读，重点关注<a href=\"reform-blueprint/third-plenum-decisions\">三中全会决定</a>的理论突破与<a href=\"assessment/institutional-advantages\">制度优势</a>的转化逻辑，并横向对照兄弟 hub。</li>\n<li><strong>一般读者</strong>：从<a href=\"reform-blueprint/third-plenum-decisions\">三中全会决定</a>入门，再读<a href=\"assessment/future-direction\">未来方向</a>把握改革走向即可。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>理解本 hub 建议先具备改革开放史的基本脉络。可先了解<a href=\"../../deng-xiaoping-theory/reform-and-opening-up/decision-background/third-plenum-turning-point\">十一届三中全会的历史转折</a>与<a href=\"../../deng-xiaoping-theory/reform-and-opening-up/economic-reform/price-reform\">价格改革</a>，在纵向比较中理解十八届三中全会对1978年改革的承接与升级，新时代&quot;全面深化&quot;的&quot;全面&quot;与&quot;深化&quot;方能凸显其分量。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reform-blueprint","title":"改革蓝图","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/comprehensive-deepening-reform/reform-blueprint","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"third-plenum-decisions","title":"三中全会决定","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/comprehensive-deepening-reform/reform-blueprint/third-plenum-decisions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"top-level-design","title":"顶层设计","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/comprehensive-deepening-reform/reform-blueprint/top-level-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reform-methodology","title":"改革方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/comprehensive-deepening-reform/reform-blueprint/reform-methodology"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"key-areas","title":"重点领域","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/comprehensive-deepening-reform/key-areas","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"state-enterprise-reform","title":"国企改革","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/comprehensive-deepening-reform/key-areas/state-enterprise-reform"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fiscal-tax-reform","title":"财税改革","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/comprehensive-deepening-reform/key-areas/fiscal-tax-reform"},{"seq":3,"slug":"judicial-reform","title":"司法改革","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/comprehensive-deepening-reform/key-areas/judicial-reform"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"assessment","title":"成效评估","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/comprehensive-deepening-reform/assessment","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"institutional-advantages","title":"制度优势","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/comprehensive-deepening-reform/assessment/institutional-advantages"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reform-challenges","title":"改革挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/comprehensive-deepening-reform/assessment/reform-challenges"},{"seq":3,"slug":"future-direction","title":"未来方向","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/comprehensive-deepening-reform/assessment/future-direction"}]}]}